WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.734
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.734 --> 00:00:04.667
Thank you for being here.
Thank you for watching.

00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:06.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:08.000
Hot crowd.
-Hot.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.601
-Well, it's officially
that time of year.

00:00:09.601 --> 00:00:11.367
College students
are on spring break.

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:13.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.868 --> 00:00:15.467
I knew it.

00:00:15.467 --> 00:00:17.968
Yeah, it's that crazy few weeks
when even Florida is like,

00:00:17.968 --> 00:00:19.100
"I got to get out of Florida."

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:20.534
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.534 --> 00:00:21.934
That's right,
spring break is here,

00:00:21.934 --> 00:00:23.434
but I read that
due to inflation,

00:00:23.434 --> 00:00:25.267
everything from flights
to hotels

00:00:25.267 --> 00:00:27.567
to food is more expensive.

00:00:27.567 --> 00:00:29.434
Instead of yelling, "We're going
to Daytona Beach,"

00:00:29.434 --> 00:00:31.834
kids are going, "We're going to
Dayton, Ohio."

00:00:31.834 --> 00:00:35.834
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:35.834 --> 00:00:37.667
Yeah, this year instead of
a round of shots,

00:00:37.667 --> 00:00:39.801
you'll buy one shot
and everyone takes a little sip.

00:00:39.801 --> 00:00:42.300
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:45.234
Speaking of college,
March Madness is here.

00:00:45.234 --> 00:00:47.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:47.434 --> 00:00:48.901
I know.

00:00:48.901 --> 00:00:50.601
Do you guys remember
Sister Jean?

00:00:50.601 --> 00:00:53.968
She's the nun who cheers for
Loyola-Chicago basketball team.

00:00:53.968 --> 00:00:57.667
She'll be attending this year's
tournament at 102 years old.

00:00:57.667 --> 00:01:01.701
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah.

00:01:01.701 --> 00:01:04.801
In fact, Sister Jean was just
asked about her return.

00:01:04.801 --> 00:01:06.033
Check out what she had to say.

00:01:06.033 --> 00:01:07.801
She said first,
"It's very exciting

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:10.400
to be back
in the NCAA Tournament."

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:13.734
Then she added, "I'm #turnt to
watch my Gucci fam

00:01:13.734 --> 00:01:15.767
pound these dank opps
in the paint,

00:01:15.767 --> 00:01:18.934
and simp bougie teams like Yale
get smoked, no cap."

00:01:18.934 --> 00:01:23.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:23.601 --> 00:01:26.300
And finally, she said, "Cuz when
it comes to a championship,

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:27.834
I'm low-key thirsty, AF!

00:01:27.834 --> 00:01:30.133
Sksksksk! Sheesh!

00:01:30.133 --> 00:01:34.701
[ Cheers and applause ]
Pumped.

00:01:34.701 --> 00:01:36.634
[ Laughter ]
Let's get to some news.

00:01:36.634 --> 00:01:39.367
This is really exciting.
Today the Senate unanimously

00:01:39.367 --> 00:01:43.100
passed a bill to make
Daylight Savings Time permanent!

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:45.100
Oh!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:47.467
Yes!

00:01:47.467 --> 00:01:49.067
I don't think people were
this happy

00:01:49.067 --> 00:01:50.767
when Pfizer announced
they had a vaccine.

00:01:50.767 --> 00:01:52.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.234 --> 00:01:54.400
Today everyone in the Senate
was like, "What happens now?

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:56.267
We've never passed a bill
before. This is weird."

00:01:56.267 --> 00:01:57.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.667 --> 00:01:59.067
Meanwhile,
every wall clock said,

00:01:59.067 --> 00:02:02.267
"But that's the only time
you ever touch me."

00:02:02.267 --> 00:02:06.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.434 --> 00:02:08.267
Thank you. That's my acting.

00:02:08.267 --> 00:02:10.801
That's as good as it gets,
sorry.

00:02:10.801 --> 00:02:13.501
Some business news --
After more than two years,

00:02:13.501 --> 00:02:16.701
Costco is dropping
its pandemic shopping hours

00:02:16.701 --> 00:02:18.634
that were reserved
just for seniors.

00:02:18.634 --> 00:02:20.000
[ Audience aws ]
Yep.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.100
Costco said, "We feel it's once
again safe for seniors

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:23.834
to be stampeded
for toilet paper."

00:02:23.834 --> 00:02:25.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.367 --> 00:02:27.834
Right now seniors are holding
free-sample toothpicks

00:02:27.834 --> 00:02:29.100
like, "Stay back! Stay back!"

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:31.133
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.133 --> 00:02:33.868
Switching gears, doctors
and experts are warning against

00:02:33.868 --> 00:02:35.934
a new viral trend of swallowing

00:02:35.934 --> 00:02:38.167
fish-tank cleaner
to fight aging.

00:02:38.167 --> 00:02:39.901
-Ohh.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.901 --> 00:02:42.067
-You know, if that really
worked, I think goldfish would

00:02:42.067 --> 00:02:44.000
live longer than six days,
you know what I'm saying?

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:47.534
Horse dewormer,
fish-tank cleaner?

00:02:47.534 --> 00:02:49.868
Now when you go to the vet,
half the patients are people.

00:02:49.868 --> 00:02:52.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.367 --> 00:02:55.033
Yep, some people claim
it's an anti-aging trick

00:02:55.033 --> 00:02:57.400
and it works 'cause you don't
age anymore when you die.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:59.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.834 --> 00:03:03.000
Well, last night was part one of
"The Bachelor" season finale,

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:06.000
and Clayton's family joined him
to talk about his big decision.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.634
The show can be
pretty emotional,

00:03:07.634 --> 00:03:08.901
so I thought we could help.

00:03:08.901 --> 00:03:10.234
Here's that moment, revoiced,

00:03:10.234 --> 00:03:12.901
with the least emotional person
we know, Siri.

00:03:12.901 --> 00:03:16.767
This is "Let's Get Siri-ous."

00:03:16.767 --> 00:03:20.567
-Let's get Siri-ous.

00:03:20.567 --> 00:03:23.234
-I told myself I'm only going to
fall in love with one woman.

00:03:23.234 --> 00:03:26.033
I will not allow myself to fall
in love with multiple women.

00:03:26.033 --> 00:03:28.534
I won't do it.
And I fell in love with three.

00:03:28.534 --> 00:03:31.000
I wish I never would have fallen
in love with three women.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:32.567
I knew my heart didn't want to
do it,

00:03:32.567 --> 00:03:34.234
but I allowed my mind
to go there.

00:03:34.234 --> 00:03:37.100
And now that I'm there, it's
like I bleeped everything up.

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:40.000
I don't know how you can be
in love with three people.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.767
I love you no matter
what happens,

00:03:41.767 --> 00:03:44.400
but you screwed the pooch
in my opinion.

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:47.267
I'm so broken.

00:03:47.267 --> 00:03:48.834
Bha ha ha ha.

00:03:48.834 --> 00:03:50.701
Ga ha ha hoo hoo.

00:03:50.701 --> 00:03:51.601
-Wow.

00:03:51.601 --> 00:03:59.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:01.267
And finally,
down in Australia --

00:04:01.267 --> 00:04:02.968
we love Australia --
they watch our show.

00:04:02.968 --> 00:04:05.801
The prime minister's office,
they just released a new logo

00:04:05.801 --> 00:04:08.167
for a group called
The Women's Network.

00:04:08.167 --> 00:04:10.200
Okay, but it was criticized by

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:11.501
pretty much everyone
on the Internet.

00:04:11.501 --> 00:04:13.901
See if you can figure out why.

00:04:13.901 --> 00:04:20.601
[ Laughter ]

00:04:20.601 --> 00:04:21.934
I didn't like it
at first either,

00:04:21.934 --> 00:04:23.834
but it really grows on you.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:23.834 --> 00:04:24.968
We have a great show, everybody.

